flowchart TD
    DEV[Developer] --> CLI[AWS CLI<br/>cloudvault profile]
    CLI --> S3[(S3<br/>cloudvault-documents-dev01)]

    %% Deployed Phase 2 EC2 workload and access path
    CLI -->|Start session| SSM[AWS Systems Manager<br/>Session Manager]
    EC2[EC2: CloudVaultEC2Dev01<br/>Amazon Linux 2023 / t3.micro]
    EC2 -->|SSM Agent / outbound connection| SSM
    EC2 -->|Attached| PROFILE[CloudVaultEC2InstanceProfile]
    PROFILE -->|Contains| ROLE[CloudVaultEC2Role]
    ROLE -->|Customer-managed policy| POLICY[CloudVaultS3DocumentAccess]
    ROLE -->|AWS-managed policy| SSMPOL[AmazonSSMManagedInstanceCore]
    POLICY -->|List and object access restricted to| PREFIX[S3 documents/*]
    EC2 -->|Verified list, upload, download, delete| PREFIX
    PREFIX --> S3

    %% Current EC2 configuration
    EC2 --> ROOT[Root EBS volume<br/>8 GiB gp3 / encrypted]
    EC2 --> SG[Security group<br/>No inbound rules / outbound allowed]
    EC2 --> META2[IMDSv2 required<br/>No static AWS access keys]
    EC2 --> NET[Default VPC / public subnet<br/>No SSH key pair]

    %% Existing Phase 1 S3 controls and access workflows
    S3 --> VER[Versioning enabled<br/>Delete markers retain prior versions]
    S3 --> ENC[SSE-S3<br/>AES256]
    S3 --> BPA[Block Public Access<br/>All controls enabled]
    S3 --> LIFE[Lifecycle rule<br/>Noncurrent versions: 30 days]
    S3 --> META[Object metadata<br/>Version-specific]

    DEV --> SDK[Python / Boto3<br/>cloudvault profile]
    SDK --> PRESIGN[Generate presigned URL]
    PRESIGN --> GET[Temporary GET access]
    PRESIGN --> PUT[Temporary PUT access]
    GET --> S3
    PUT --> S3

    S3 --> CW[CloudWatch<br/>Daily storage metrics]
    S3 -. Management events .-> CT[CloudTrail<br/>Event History]
